@startuml
title 加载模型用例时序图

actor 用户 as USER
participant "WEBUI\n(Vue3 页面)" as WEBUI
participant "JsApi\n(fsSimApi.js /\nstore)" as JSApi
participant "Controller\n(SimController)" as CTRL
participant "Service\n(McpClient /\nFsModelFile)" as SVC
participant "FS\n(MCP Server\n仿真引擎)" as FS
participant "DB\n(mysql\nfs_model_file)" as DB

USER -> WEBUI : 1. 模型库模型列表中\n点击“仿真”命令
WEBUI -> JSApi : 2. fsSimLoadModel\n({id, loadInUI})
JSApi -> CTRL : 3. POST\n/fscloud/sim/loadModel
CTRL -> SVC : 4. getById(fileId)\n查模型库记录
SVC -> DB : 5. SELECT\nfs_model_file
DB --> SVC : 6. 返回模型记录
SVC --> CTRL : 7. 模型记录
CTRL -> SVC : 8. mcpClientService\n.loadModel(...)
SVC -> FS : 9. MCP tools/call\nloadRemoteSimulationModel
FS --> SVC : 10. modelId\nstatus=LOADED
SVC --> CTRL : 11. 业务 JSON
CTRL -> SVC : 12. updateById\n回写 modelId
SVC -> DB : 13. UPDATE\nfs_model_file
CTRL --> JSApi : 14. LoadModelDto
JSApi --> WEBUI : 15. 展示已加载模型

@enduml
